# Specializations: UPP
rmc-squad-spec-upp-vdv-name = Airborne Troops (VDV)
rmc-squad-spec-upp-vdv-desc = Airborne assault doctrine emphasizing rapid breakthrough. Maneuverable carbines, submachine guns and lightweight armor for maximum battlefield agility.
rmc-squad-spec-upp-vdv-summary = Gear: Blue VDV beret, 6B-VDV helmet, VDV body armor. Armaments: Type 71C carbine, Type-19 SMG, Type 23 shotgun.
rmc-squad-spec-upp-vdv-announced = [SQUAD HQ]: Squad is operating under VDV Airborne doctrine! Collect airborne kit and armaments from standard vendors!

rmc-squad-spec-upp-sof-name = Special Operations Forces (SOF)
rmc-squad-spec-upp-sof-desc = Heavy assault doctrine designed for breach-and-clear and trench holding. Heavy body armor, 7B-Zvezda / Altyn-S helmets and suppression firepower of Type 71 rifles.
rmc-squad-spec-upp-sof-summary = Gear: Red SSO beret, 7B-Zvezda / Altyn-S helmet, heavy SOF armor. Armaments: Type 71 assault rifle, Type 23 shotgun, armor-piercing munitions.
rmc-squad-spec-upp-sof-announced = [SQUAD HQ]: Squad is operating under SOF Heavy Assault doctrine! Collect heavy armor and armaments from standard vendors!

rmc-squad-spec-upp-recon-name = Recon & Rangers ("Разбойники")
rmc-squad-spec-upp-recon-desc = Reconnaissance and sabotage doctrine focusing on stealth and mid-to-long range precision fires. Camouflage cowls, Type 88 marksman rifles and suppressed weapons.
rmc-squad-spec-upp-recon-summary = Gear: Boonies, M8 marksman cowl, commando armor. Armaments: Type 88 DMR, Type 64 suppressed SMG, Type 73 carbine, suppressors.
rmc-squad-spec-upp-recon-announced = [SQUAD HQ]: Squad is operating under Recon doctrine! Collect camouflage gear and suppressed armaments from standard vendors!
